   "faq": [
    {
     "ques": "Why do I see multiple Cashback entries for a single order?",
     "ans": "AJIO tracks each item individually, which is why there are separate entries for each item you purchased in your order"
    },
    {
     "ques": "Why is my Cashback tracked at a lower amount than I expected?",
     "ans": "Your Cashback is calculated on the order value, excluding payments made via wallets, gift cards, or vouchers. For example, if you place a Rs.1,000 order and pay Rs.500 via Credit/Debit Card and Rs.500 using a gift voucher, Cashback will be calculated only on Rs.500, as wallet/gift voucher payments are not eligible"
    },
    {
     "ques": "What happens if I return or exchange an item?",
     "ans": "If you return/exchange an item, the Cashback for that item will be cancelled. Always check the AJIO's Terms and Conditions before clicking out through CashKaro"
    },
    {
     "ques": "Can I use coupon codes and still earn Cashback?",
     "ans": "Yes, you can use Coupon Codes mentioned only on CashKaro or AJIO's website.  Using codes from other sources will result in Cashback cancellation"
    },
